# Global styles
## Disable Drop Sound for everything
Show
    DisableDropSound
    Continue
## Normal Rariry Items
Show
Rarity Normal
    SetTextColor 200 200 200
    Continue
## Magic Rarity items
Show
Rarity Magic
    SetTextColor 136 136 255
    Continue
## Rare Rarity items
Show
Rarity Rare
    SetTextColor 255 255 119
    Continue
## Unique Rariry Items
Show
Rarity Unique
    SetTextColor 175 96 37
    Continue
## Str bases
Show
BaseType "Plate Vest" "Iron Hat"
    SetBorderColor 255 0 0
    Continue
